{
  "about": "Get-ChatqJobs (src/queue.ps1): every *.json file in data/queue holding a job, in the queue order - put first (latest first ahead), then continues (kind continue, or rule restart), then the rest; each oldest createdAt first, then by [int]seq. Sort-Object is not stable, so ties land as each edition's .NET sort leaves them. Get-ChatqLane (src/watcher.ps1): provider, or provider|home. Rust: jobs::get_jobs, jobs::job_files, jobs::lane",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "keys-basic",
      "input": {
        "kind": "order",
        "zone": "Korea Standard Time",
        "utcOffsetMinutes": 540,
        "files": [
          {
            "name": "a01.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a01\",\"tag\":\"a01\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T01:00:00Z\",\"seq\":1}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a02.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a02\",\"tag\":\"a02\",\"first\":\"2026-10-15T03:00:00Z\"}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a03.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a03\",\"tag\":\"a03\",\"kind\":\"continue\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T02:00:00Z\"}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a04.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a04\",\"tag\":\"a04\",\"rule\":\"restart\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T00:30:00Z\"}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a05.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a05\",\"tag\":\"a05\",\"first\":\"2026-10-15T04:00:00Z\"}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a06.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a06\",\"tag\":\"a06\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T00:00:00Z\",\"seq\":2}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a07.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a07\",\"tag\":\"a07\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-15T00:00:00Z\",\"seq\":1}"
          },
          {
            "name": "a08.json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a08\",\"tag\":\"a08\",\"first\":\"2026-10-15T03:00:00Z\",\"kind\":\"continue\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-14T00:00:00Z\"}"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "listed": [
          "a01.json",
          "a02.json",
          "a03.json",
          "a04.json",
          "a05.json",
          "a06.json",
          "a07.json",
          "a08.json"
